  "recordType": "rule-section",
  "ruleText": "He-P 2708.03 Permit Issuance and Duration.\n\n(a) If the application for a milk route permit meets the requirements of He-P 2708.01, a permit shall be issued.\n\n(b) All permits shall expire on August 1 each year.\n\nSource. #12631, INTERIM, eff 9-28-18, EXPIRES: 3-27-19; ss by #12743, eff 3-20-19; ss by #13175, eff 3-2-21",
  "source": "https://github.com/GraniteState/adm-rules-data/blob/1c92d82e0f03a582ca5b7a578588edf38de2318e/raw/2026-11-15/state_agencies/he-p2700.html"
